    "full": "Charles Andrew Hofling with Florinda Chanaj Kin, Lacandon Maya–Spanish–English Dictionary / Diccionario maya lacandón–español–inglés (University of Utah Press, 2014), based on data by Una Canger and Henrik Bergqvist. Southern variety, from Lacanjá Chansayab."
