    "notes": [
      "Length and tone change the meaning: long vowels can have high tone (kíinsik «kill it»).",
      "The old Mayan l became r: Yucatec k'uchul is k'uchur «arrive» here.",
      "ts is merging with s in the speech of young people.",
      "b is implosive: air goes in as you say it. d' and g appear only in a few words."
    ]
